Write a Dockerfile for Database (Mysql)
Docker in git repo url : https://github.com/UmeshChandra2001/Doc_Vol_Task1

Create an Image
docker build -t mssqlimg:v2 .

Create a Volume for database
docker volume create mysqlvol1

Create a container for database and mount the volume (/var/lib/mysql)
docker run -itd --name mysqlcont2 --mount src=mysqlvol1,destination=/var/lib/mysql -p 9985:3306 mssqlimg:v3
docker exec -it mysqlcont2 bash

Mount the volume to multiple containers (2-4)
